      "cooked": "<p>Hey there,</p><p>As everyone knows, promo cards are like gold dust. If you can find them then you have to pay a ridiculous amount of money for them. As &gt;G has said that they are ok with people printing their own copies (so awesome of them to say that) I am currently finding all the promos I can. This is where I need some help. I have found decent and usable images of all the promos through various means, some on here and some on BGG. The only ones I can't find a decent image of are <strong>Spite: Agent of Gloom &amp; Gloomweaver Skinwalker.</strong> So, does anyone have a copy that they can either scan or send to me please? I would be eternally grateful to you! :)</p><p>Simon</p>",
